      "writtenOn": "2017-07-28T13:59:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "this is checking on the value of the attribute, correct?\n\nIs the result of obj[1].get(attr) a tuple? What are the values in that tuple?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1396,
        "startChar": 40,
        "endLine": 1396,
