      "writtenOn": "2017-07-28T20:06:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "yep, sounds right. LDAP will let you specify the same attribute multiple times, which is why values are always lists. Checking obj[1].get(attr)[0] in addition to obj[1].get(attr) would only be in case someone specified the name attribute twice, and the first time gave it an empty-string as a value... I don\u0027t know if that\u0027s possible or not, but I guess it doesn\u0027t hurt to handle it.",
